{"seq":1,"slug":"what-mcp-solves","title":"MCP 解决什么问题","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-ready-apis-and-tools/mcp-and-tool-protocols/what-mcp-solves","wordCount":1978,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"mcp-解决什么问题\">MCP 解决什么问题</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>Model Context Protocol（MCP）</strong> 是一个把 AI 应用与外部工具、数据源连接起来的开放标准，2024 年 11 月由 Anthropic 开源发布。它要解决的核心问题是一个成本模型：设有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个 AI 应用和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 个工具/数据源，没有公共协议时每一对（应用，工具）都要写一份私有集成，总成本是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>pair</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{pair}} = N \\times M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pair</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>；协议化把「工具方实现一次 server、宿主实现一次 client」抽成公开规范，成本降为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>std</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{std}} = N + M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">std</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>围绕这一替换，本篇讨论三件事：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>成本模型</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\times M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 为何随生态繁荣爆炸，协议化又如何在增长律层面把它压平。</li>\n<li><strong>可核验的标准化路径</strong>：从 2024-11 首版到中立基金会治理，约两年内被真实世界验证的时间线。</li>\n<li><strong>协议管不到的地方</strong>：连接之上「工具好不好用」、高频内部调用是否值得绕行、快速演进带来的迁移税。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"从-n-m-到-n-m-的问题背景\">从 N×M 到 N+M 的问题背景</h2><p>2024 年 11 月 25 日，Anthropic 开源发布了 Model Context Protocol（MCP）——一个把 AI 应用与外部工具、数据源连接起来的开放标准（发布当天的报道见 The Verge：<a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/2024/11/25/24305774/anthropic-model-context-protocol-data-sources）。它的出发点是一个具体的工程痛点：每个\">https://www.theverge.com/2024/11/25/24305774/anthropic-model-context-protocol-data-sources）。它的出发点是一个具体的工程痛点：每个</a> AI 应用都要为每个工具单独写一份集成，集成数量随两边规模相乘增长。这场标准化的需求侧动力——agent 正成为系统的第三类消费者——见<a href=\"../why-design-for-agent-consumers/agents-as-a-new-consumer\">Agent 是一类新的消费者</a>。本文把这个痛点拆成一个成本模型，看协议化如何把它压缩成线性问题，再用可核验的时间线还原这条标准化路线在两年内被真实世界检验的全过程——以及它管不到的地方。</p>\n<h2 id=\"集成成本的数学-n-m-为何爆炸\">集成成本的数学：N×M 为何爆炸</h2><p>设有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个 AI 应用和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 个工具/数据源。没有公共协议时，每一对（应用，工具）都需要一份私有集成：认证方式、数据格式、错误处理各写一遍。总集成成本是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>pair</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{pair}}(N,M) = N \\times M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pair</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个模型的杀伤力在增长律：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 各翻一倍，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>pair</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{pair}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pair</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 变为四倍。生态越繁荣——应用越多、工具越多——浪费越大。Anthropic 在发布公告中正是以「N×M 问题」命名这一痛点的（原始公告：<a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/news/model-context-protocol；协议由\">https://www.anthropic.com/news/model-context-protocol；协议由</a> David Soria Parra 与 Justin Spahr-Summers 在 Anthropic 创造，条目见 Wikipedia: Model Context Protocol）。</p>\n<p>这不是没人试过解决。OpenAI 2023 年推出的 function calling API 与 ChatGPT 插件框架是早期方案，但连接器绑定单一厂商的接口约定——换一家 AI 应用宿主，同样的工具要再适配一次，本质仍是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\times M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 的厂商内特例。MCP 在消息流设计上借鉴了 Language Server Protocol（LSP）的经验：LSP 当年正是用一个公开协议终结了「每种编辑器 × 每种语言」的私有集成矩阵。</p>\n<h2 id=\"协议化的答案-一次实现-双向复用\">协议化的答案：一次实现、双向复用</h2><p>MCP 的做法是把「应用如何连工具」抽成一个公开规范：工具方实现一次 <strong>MCP server</strong>，即可被所有实现了 <strong>MCP client</strong> 的宿主接入；反过来，宿主实现一次 client 就吃下整个 server 生态。成本变为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>std</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{std}}(N,M) = N + M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">std</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>两边各翻倍时只增约一倍，两者之差随规模扩大而拉开：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>pair</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>std</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{pair}} - C_{\\text{std}} = NM - N - M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pair</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">std</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>架构上，宿主应用内嵌一个或多个 client，每个 client 与一个 server 保持一对一有状态会话：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph Host[&quot;宿主应用(Claude Code / IDE / chat app)&quot;]&#10;        C1[&quot;MCP client&quot;]&#10;        C2[&quot;MCP client&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    C1 -- &quot;stdio(本地子进程)&quot; --&gt; S1[&quot;GitHub server&quot;]&#10;    C2 -- &quot;Streamable HTTP(远程)&quot; --&gt; S2[&quot;企业数据库 server&quot;]&#10;    C2 -- &quot;Streamable HTTP&quot; --&gt; S3[&quot;Slack server&quot;]\">graph LR\n    subgraph Host[\"宿主应用(Claude Code / IDE / chat app)\"]\n        C1[\"MCP client\"]\n        C2[\"MCP client\"]\n    end\n    C1 -- \"stdio(本地子进程)\" --&gt; S1[\"GitHub server\"]\n    C2 -- \"Streamable HTTP(远程)\" --&gt; S2[\"企业数据库 server\"]\n    C2 -- \"Streamable HTTP\" --&gt; S3[\"Slack server\"]</pre><p>协议本体以 JSON-RPC 编码消息，传输层有两种官方定义：本地进程走 stdio；远程连接自规范修订 <strong>2025-03-26</strong> 起统一为 Streamable HTTP，取代先前的 HTTP+SSE 方案，旧路径仅作兼容保留（规范原文：<a href=\"https://modelcontextprotocol.io/specification/2025-03-26/basic/transports）。\">https://modelcontextprotocol.io/specification/2025-03-26/basic/transports）。</a></p>\n<p>值得诚实面对的是这笔交换的代价：协议化引入一层间接——每次调用经过 client/server 封装，延迟与调试复杂度高于进程内直调；协议演进要社区协调，永远快不过私有接口。换来的是两侧彻底解耦：工具升级不要求应用改代码，应用换底层模型更与工具无关。规模越大，这笔交易越划算；单机脚本里两个组件之间硬套 MCP 则纯属负收益。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范演进时间线-两年走完的路\">规范演进时间线：两年走完的路</h2><p>从一家厂商的开源项目到行业事实标准，MCP 的速度罕见。下表按可核验的时间点还原（来源均为官方规范站 changelog 或所列报道）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时间</th>\n<th>版本 / 事件</th>\n<th>关键内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>2024-11</td>\n<td>开源发布；首个规范修订 2024-11-05</td>\n<td>明确对标 N×M 集成问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2025-03-26</td>\n<td>规范修订</td>\n<td>Streamable HTTP 取代 HTTP+SSE；建立 OAuth 2.1 授权框架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2025-03</td>\n<td>OpenAI 宣布采纳，Agents SDK 支持 MCP</td>\n<td>TechCrunch 报道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2025-04</td>\n<td>Google DeepMind 宣布 Gemini 将支持</td>\n<td>TechCrunch 报道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2025-06-18</td>\n<td>规范修订</td>\n<td>移除 JSON-RPC batching；新增结构化工具输出与 elicitation；按 RFC 8707 加固授权</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2025-09-08</td>\n<td>官方 Registry 以 preview 上线</td>\n<td>registry.modelcontextprotocol.io，开放目录 + 子注册表机制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2025-09</td>\n<td>OpenAI 把 MCP 接入 ChatGPT 应用侧</td>\n<td>VentureBeat 报道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2025-11-25</td>\n<td>规范修订</td>\n<td>OAuth Client ID Metadata Documents、实验性 Tasks、URL 模式 elicitation</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2025-12</td>\n<td>项目捐入 Linux Foundation 旗下 AAIF</td>\n<td>由 Anthropic、Block、OpenAI 共同发起</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>主要出处：各版本 changelog 见 <a href=\"https://modelcontextprotocol.io/specification/2025-11-25/changelog\">https://modelcontextprotocol.io/specification/2025-11-25/changelog</a> ；Registry 公告全文见 <a href=\"https://blog.modelcontextprotocol.io/posts/2025-09-08-mcp-registry-preview/\">https://blog.modelcontextprotocol.io/posts/2025-09-08-mcp-registry-preview/</a> ；OpenAI 采纳见 TechCrunch 2025-03-26《OpenAI adopts rival Anthropic&#39;s standard for connecting AI models to data》；Google 采纳见 TechCrunch 2025-04-09；ChatGPT 接入见 VentureBeat 2025-09-11；基金会捐赠见 TechCrunch 2025-12-09。</p>\n<p>两个节点尤其说明问题。其一，<strong>Registry 补上了标准的最后一块拼图</strong>：此前「有哪些 server 可用」靠社区口口相传，官方目录提供机器可查的 API，并以 denylist 机制处理恶意或冒名条目——但 preview 阶段官方明确不承诺数据持久性，生产系统应锁定快照自行缓存。其二，<strong>捐入 Linux Foundation 中立基金会</strong>直接回应了「单一厂商标准」的结构性疑虑：治理权与商业利益脱钩后，竞争对手的共建才可持续，这也是 LSP、Kubernetes 等前例走过的同一条路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"标准化的收益与三条边界\">标准化的收益与三条边界</h2><p>红利不止省代码。<strong>可移植</strong>：团队写的 server 能服务所有主流宿主；<strong>可组合</strong>：同一 host 内多个 server 的能力天然可拼接；<strong>可预期</strong>：规范文本成为争议仲裁地而非某家 SDK 的文档。这些是 USB-C 与 LSP 反复验证过的标准经济学。</p>\n<p>但它有三条边界。第一，MCP 解决「连接」，不解决「好用」——把一个烂 API 包上 MCP 外壳，得到的是一个协议合规的烂工具，语义设计仍是人的工作（下一篇<a href=\"exposing-capabilities-as-tools\">把能力暴露为工具</a>专门展开）。第二，对高频、低延迟、强一致的内部调用，直连 RPC 通常仍优于绕行协议，别为了「agent-ready」四个字把所有流量塞进 MCP。第三，快速演进期意味着迁移税：2024-11 写的 SSE 集成到 2025-03 就要评估迁往 Streamable HTTP，跟随规范节奏本身就是一项持续成本——生产部署应声明所依据的规范版本，而不是漂移在「最新」上。日期式版本号、废弃窗口与协商机制的完整纪律，见<a href=\"../tool-design-in-practice/evolving-and-versioning-agent-apis\">演进与版本化</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\times M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N + M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 不是修辞，是增长律层面的差别。MCP 用 client/server 架构与 JSON-RPC 协议完成这次替换，并在约两年内拿到 OpenAI 与 Google 的采纳、官方注册表和中立治理。协议解决了连接问题；连接之上工具好不好用，是另一门必须单独学的功课。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"MCP 解决什么问题","id":"mcp-解决什么问题"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从 N×M 到 N+M 的问题背景","id":"从-n-m-到-n-m-的问题背景"},{"level":2,"text":"集成成本的数学：N×M 为何爆炸","id":"集成成本的数学-n-m-为何爆炸"},{"level":2,"text":"协议化的答案：一次实现、双向复用","id":"协议化的答案-一次实现-双向复用"},{"level":2,"text":"规范演进时间线：两年走完的路","id":"规范演进时间线-两年走完的路"},{"level":2,"text":"标准化的收益与三条边界","id":"标准化的收益与三条边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"把错误设计成指引","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-ready-apis-and-tools/designing-agent-friendly-tools/errors-as-guidance"},"next":{"title":"把能力暴露为工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-ready-apis-and-tools/mcp-and-tool-protocols/exposing-capabilities-as-tools"}}